---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Tim Shores - Data Storyteller"
    description="Data Storyteller & Communication Strategist - Turning Complexity into Clear Decisions"
>
    <div class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <h1>Hi, I'm Tim</h1>
            <div class="subtitle-group">
                <p class="subtitle-main">Data Storyteller</p>
                <p class="subtitle-secondary">Community Facilitator</p>
                <p class="subtitle-accent">Turning Complexity into Strategy</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portrait-container">
            <img id="portrait" src="/portrait-a.png" alt="Tim Shores" class="portrait-image" />
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <div class="about-card">
        <p>
            I help people make sense of complex information — finding the signal, shaping the story, and making it useful.
        </p>
        <p>
            My work lives at the intersection of data, storytelling, strategy, and community. I turn systems thinking, technical details, and messy datasets into clear insights people can act on.
        </p>
        <p>
            With this in mind, always: <em>"By the time it can be captured in numbers, it's too late"</em> — Peter Drucker. The future is too complex to behave according to our frameworks.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul class="skills-list">
        <li>Data analysis</li>
        <li>Communication strategy</li>
        <li>Social entrepreneurship</li>
        <li>Policy analysis</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <div class="experience-item">
        <h3>Technical Education Content Developer</h3>
        <p class="company">Cisco • 2022 - Present</p>
        <p>Researching and delivering Cisco Secure Access technical documentation in collaboration with product, engineering, and UX teams. Facilitating UX research and content design projects in 20+ quarterly sprints in alignment with research-driven customer outcomes and product team goals. Researched and wrote Cisco Assistant LLM feature documentation for Secure Access and collaborated on a hackathon proof-of-concept demonstrating LLM generation of dynamic, user identity-based Cisco technical content.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="experience-item">
        <h3>Director of Data & Donor Experience</h3>
        <p class="company">Hope for Haiti • 2019 - 2023</p>
        <p>Hope for Haiti’s Mission Statement: To improve the quality of life for the Haitian people, particularly children. My responsibilities: Revenue data management; Grantwriting and grant pipeline management; Donor services and support.</p>
    </div>

	<div class="experience-item">
        <h3>Platform Analyst</h3>
        <p class="company">VentureWell • 2016 - 2019</p>
        <ul>
			<li>Nonprofit working to cultivate early stage ventures to commercialize high-impact STEM innovations.</li>
			<li>The Information Systems team collaborates to evaluate, design, and implement solutions for: Programmatic community building and network weaving; impact evaluation and program monitoring; grants management; funder, investor, and program participant relationship management; digital marketing; event management.</li>
			<li>I was the first responder for Salesforce development planning and implementation, and the second-tier resource for user support and training.</li>
			<li>I worked with the following platform components: Salesforce Community, Pardot, Service Cloud, Process Builder and Flow, Apex triggers and classes, Lightning Web Components, Nonprofit Success Pack, TaskRay.
			<li>I worked with the following third-party tools: Skuid, RForcecom and RStudio, NetSuite integration via SOAP API, Form Assembly, Adobe Sign, Conga Composer, WordPress, Node.js.</li>
		</ul>
    </div>
</Layout>

<script>
    let isAlternate = false;
    const portrait = document.getElementById('portrait');

    if (portrait) {
        portrait.addEventListener('click', () => {
            isAlternate = !isAlternate;
            portrait.src = isAlternate ? '/portrait-b.png' : '/portrait-a.png';
        });
    }
</script>

<style>
    .hero-section {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;  /* Reduced from 3rem */
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .hero-text {
        flex: 1;
    }

    .subtitle-group {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .subtitle-main,
	.subtitle-secondary,
	.subtitle-accent {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--ink-fade);
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.subtitle-accent {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

    .portrait-container {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        position: relative;
    }

    .portrait-image {
        width: 400px;
        height: 400px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        border: 3px solid var(--manila-dark);
        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        position: relative;
        cursor: default;
    }

    .portrait-image:hover {
        transform: translate(-8px, -8px);
        box-shadow:
            1px 1px 0 0 var(--accent),
            2px 2px 0 0 var(--accent),
            3px 3px 0 0 var(--accent),
            4px 4px 0 0 var(--accent),
            5px 5px 0 0 var(--accent),
            6px 6px 0 0 var(--accent),
            7px 7px 0 0 var(--accent),
            8px 8px 0 0 var(--accent),
            9px 9px 0 0 var(--accent),
            10px 10px 0 0 var(--accent),
            11px 11px 0 0 var(--accent),
            12px 12px 0 0 var(--accent),
            13px 13px 0 0 var(--accent),
            14px 14px 0 0 var(--accent),
            15px 15px 0 0 var(--accent),
            16px 16px 0 0 var(--accent),
            17px 17px 0 0 var(--accent),
            18px 18px 0 0 var(--accent),
            19px 19px 0 0 var(--accent),
            20px 20px 0 0 var(--accent),
            21px 21px 0 0 var(--accent),
            22px 22px 0 0 var(--accent),
            23px 23px 0 0 var(--accent),
            24px 24px 0 0 var(--accent),
            25px 25px 0 0 var(--accent);
    }

    .skills-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        list-style: none;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
        padding: 1rem;
    }

    .skills-list li {
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--ink-light);
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        position: relative;
    }

    .skills-list li:hover {
        transform: translate(-4px, -4px);
        box-shadow: 
            1px 1px 0 0 var(--accent),
            2px 2px 0 0 var(--accent),
            3px 3px 0 0 var(--accent),
            4px 4px 0 0 var(--accent),
            5px 5px 0 0 var(--accent),
            6px 6px 0 0 var(--accent),
            7px 7px 0 0 var(--accent),
            8px 8px 0 0 var(--accent),
            9px 9px 0 0 var(--accent),
            10px 10px 0 0 var(--accent),
            11px 11px 0 0 var(--accent),
            12px 12px 0 0 var(--accent);
    }

    .about-card {
        padding: 2rem;
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        margin: 1rem 0 2rem 0;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        position: relative;
    }

    .about-card:hover {
        transform: translate(-8px, -8px);
        box-shadow: 
            1px 1px 0 0 var(--accent),
            2px 2px 0 0 var(--accent),
            3px 3px 0 0 var(--accent),
            4px 4px 0 0 var(--accent),
            5px 5px 0 0 var(--accent),
            6px 6px 0 0 var(--accent),
            7px 7px 0 0 var(--accent),
            8px 8px 0 0 var(--accent),
            9px 9px 0 0 var(--accent),
            10px 10px 0 0 var(--accent),
            11px 11px 0 0 var(--accent),
            12px 12px 0 0 var(--accent),
            13px 13px 0 0 var(--accent),
            14px 14px 0 0 var(--accent),
            15px 15px 0 0 var(--accent),
            16px 16px 0 0 var(--accent),
            17px 17px 0 0 var(--accent),
            18px 18px 0 0 var(--accent),
            19px 19px 0 0 var(--accent),
            20px 20px 0 0 var(--accent),
            21px 21px 0 0 var(--accent),
            22px 22px 0 0 var(--accent),
            23px 23px 0 0 var(--accent),
            24px 24px 0 0 var(--accent),
            25px 25px 0 0 var(--accent);
    }

    .about-card p {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        max-width: none;  /* Override the global 65ch limit */
    }

    .about-card p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .experience-item {
        margin: 2rem 0;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-left: 2px solid var(--manila-dark);
        background: var(--card);
        border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        position: relative;
    }

    .experience-item:hover {
        transform: translate(-8px, -8px);
        box-shadow: 
            1px 1px 0 0 var(--accent),
            2px 2px 0 0 var(--accent),
            3px 3px 0 0 var(--accent),
            4px 4px 0 0 var(--accent),
            5px 5px 0 0 var(--accent),
            6px 6px 0 0 var(--accent),
            7px 7px 0 0 var(--accent),
            8px 8px 0 0 var(--accent),
            9px 9px 0 0 var(--accent),
            10px 10px 0 0 var(--accent),
            11px 11px 0 0 var(--accent),
            12px 12px 0 0 var(--accent),
            13px 13px 0 0 var(--accent),
            14px 14px 0 0 var(--accent),
            15px 15px 0 0 var(--accent),
            16px 16px 0 0 var(--accent),
            17px 17px 0 0 var(--accent),
            18px 18px 0 0 var(--accent),
            19px 19px 0 0 var(--accent),
            20px 20px 0 0 var(--accent),
            21px 21px 0 0 var(--accent),
            22px 22px 0 0 var(--accent),
            23px 23px 0 0 var(--accent),
            24px 24px 0 0 var(--accent),
            25px 25px 0 0 var(--accent);
    }

    .company {
        color: var(--ink-fade);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .hero-section {
            flex-direction: column-reverse;
            text-align: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .portrait-placeholder,
        .portrait-image {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
        }

        .subtitle-main {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        .subtitle-secondary {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .subtitle-accent {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .skills-list {
            justify-content: center;
        }
    }
</style>